* {{topt|Tell me more about these rewards.}}
** '''Player:''' Tell me more about these rewards.
** '''Gloria:''' But of course! People all accross Varlamore will hear of your Glory.
** '''Gloria:''' You'll get a range of benefits depending on your status.
** '''Player:''' How do I improve my status?
** '''Gloria:''' Earn more Glory of course. The more you earn, the better your standing in the city.
** '''Gloria:''' You can check your status on that board over there. I keep it up to date.
** '''Player:''' What exactly are the benefits?
** '''Gloria:''' Well...
** '''Gloria:''' Reaching Brawler status will give you access to the bank within the Colosseum.
** '''Gloria:''' Reaching Challenger status will allow you to respawn in Civitas illa Fortis if you so desire.
** '''Gloria:''' Reaching Gladiator status might persuade some of the more shady folk around the city to give you more money for... Let's just say illicit valuables.
** '''Gloria:''' Reaching Hero status will allow you to travel to the Colosseum via the Ring of Dueling.
** '''Gloria:''' Reaching Champion status will grant you free herb patch protection just west of the city.
** '''Gloria:''' And reaching Grand Champion status will unlock you the Fortis Salute emote.
** '''Player:''' Do you know how much Glory I need for each status?
** '''Gloria:''' You'll have to figure that out on your journey to becoming a Grand Champion.
** '''Player:''' Fair enough.
** {{tact|other}}
